## Pro Tip

문제점만 말하지 말고
**해결책까지 제시하는 것**이 중요하다.

### Basic

The parking situation is bad.

### Better

One thing I would change is the parking situation.

### Better + Solution

One thing I would change is the parking situation.

The main problem is that there aren't enough spaces.

I think they should build a larger parking area.

That would make the place much more convenient.

